  `encoding sweep candidates: ${tried}, self-consistent: ${encodingHits}`,
  `expected candidates for one hit: 2^256 ~ ${expectedWork.toExponential(3)}`,
  `verdict: UNSATISFIABLE — the gate cannot pass; the earlier "one hash away"`
